# Vulnerabilities the CI image scan accepts, one ID per line, each with the
# reason and the date to look at it again. Empty: nothing is accepted.

# golang.org/x/net/html denial of service, in the Caddy binary of the frontend
# image. Caddy 2.11.9, the latest release, still links x/net 0.60.0. Only
# Caddy's templates and markdown handlers parse HTML, and the Caddyfile uses
# neither. Look again at the next Caddy release (after 2026-11-12).
CVE-2026-78661
